:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
丝绒假面回廊尽头的银狐壁龛下，半枚未干的红火漆印落在波斯地毯边缘，暗门锁孔里还残留着蜂蜡碎屑。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) gte 1 and ($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) lte 5>><<set _resumePas to "MP Quest Velvet Mirage " + (($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) + 1)>><<walkicon>><<link [[继续暗层追查 (0:08)|_resumePas]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-1">
<<mpherbicon>><<link "挑出锁孔蜂蜡 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 1)>>
	你用银针轻轻挑出锁孔里残存的红蜡模，看清了内廊暗锁的三齿深浅。<span class="green">你摸清了假面暗门的锁芯构造。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	银针在锁簧上打滑，崩出一声脆响，走廊尽头传来执事的脚步声。<span class="red">你被铜棱刮痛指尖，只得退回廊柱后。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<link "闻香辨认去向 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-1">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 1)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_1_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_1_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你俯身贴近银狐壁龛底座，循着空气里若有若无的龙涎香气味，顺藤摸瓜找到了内廊暗门的通风缝。<span class="green">你借着香料轨迹摸清了假面暗门的开启机关。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往镜面沙龙 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		回廊里混杂着数十种浓淡不一的脂粉与红酒香气，扰乱了你的嗅觉判断。<span class="red">鼻尖被熏得有些发麻，你只得先退到通风廊柱旁换气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
镜面试衣沙龙的第三面斜角落地铜镜背面透出微弱穿堂风，镜框右下角的鎏金玫瑰雕花似乎可以旋动。
<<if $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_1_alt"]>><span class="teal">鼻尖萦绕着银狐壁龛下那缕龙涎香气，你在第三面斜角铜镜旁迅速锁定了气流的来源。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回试衣沙龙 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="velvet-q-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋动鎏金玫瑰 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['mp_quest_velvet_mirage_1_alt'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 290 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 2)>>
	铜镜背后弹开一道半尺宽的夹层，里面夹着一张标注观海露台炭盆暗格的羊皮便笺。<span class="green">你取出了铜镜夹层里的密信。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	玫瑰旋钮卡死在半途，镜框边缘的铜刺划破了你的手背。<span class="red">你没能打开铜镜夹层。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<link "照镜找暗门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 290 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 290>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 2)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_2_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_2_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你微调第三面斜角落地铜镜的倾角，借着壁灯折射出的光斑，一眼看清了镜背夹层的弹簧卡位。<span class="green">铜镜暗门无声滑开，露出了标有露台暗格的羊皮便笺。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去观海露台 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		试衣沙龙里的水晶灯光线交错，铜镜折射出的光斑晃花了眼，没能一次对准卡槽。<span class="red">手腕推镜框时略有些发酸，你先停手稳了稳神。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回试衣沙龙 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
观海露台角落的铸铁火盆里银炭将熄，底座青石板的排水凹槽下压着一只扁平的黄铜烟盒。
<<if $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_2_alt"]>><span class="teal">对照斜角铜镜反光标出的露台方位，你径直走到铸铁火盆前摸向了青石排水槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回观海露台 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="velvet-q-3">
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link "夹出铜烟盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-3">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['mp_quest_velvet_mirage_2_alt'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 330 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 330>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 3)>>
	你稳稳夹出那只黄铜烟盒，盒内藏着传菜铜梯的发条钥匙与三名失踪舞者的押契编号。<span class="green">你拿到了传菜梯发条钥匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火盆余烬突然爆出火星烫红了你的手腕，露台外传来侍者巡查声。<span class="red">你被火星烫伤，不得不暂避。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "撬起底板 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11900 or ($willpower or 0) gte 500>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 3)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_3_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_3_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你拿起火盆旁的黄铜火钳拨开将熄的银炭，顺着排水槽缺口一撬便掀起了底座青石板。<span class="green">压在石板下的黄铜烟盒与传菜梯钥匙稳稳落入你手中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往传菜梯 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		一阵海风掠过露台吹起残灰，迷了你的眼角，火钳尖端也在青石板边缘滑脱了一下。<span class="red">你连忙退开半步揉净眼角浮灰，等风势稍歇再撬。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回观海露台 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
拍卖暗厅东侧丝绒挂帷后的黄铜传菜梯停在半层，梯厢底板下卡着一只上了双簧锁的红木押契匣。
<<if $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_3_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭着刚才用火钳从火盆底撬出的烟盒暗码，你在丝绒挂帷后准确截停了半层的传菜梯。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="velvet-q-4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "打开双簧锁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-4">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['mp_quest_velvet_mirage_3_alt'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 380 or ($science or 0) gte 370>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 4)>>
	双簧锁应声弹开，红木匣里整齐码着二楼包厢今晚私下交割的贵宾底单。<span class="green">你查获了暗层私下交割底单。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入包厢 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	传菜梯滑轮猛地往下沉了半尺，铁缆擦破你的手掌，发出沉闷撞击声。<span class="red">滑轮异响惊动了楼下护卫。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "稳住传菜梯厢 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-4">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 12300 or ($athletics or 0) gte 370>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 4)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_4_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_4_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你一手拽紧滑轮配重副缆锁死梯厢，一手从底板夹缝里抽出了整只红木押契匣。<span class="green">押契匣被你无声取出，梯厢纹丝未动。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[进入包厢 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	配重铁块沉重异常，粗麻缆绳在掌心勒出红印也没能拉动分毫。<span class="red">虎口火辣辣地发痛，你只得先松手退开。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
二楼贵宾包厢的双层金线纱帘后，首席执事正低声交代今晚压轴展柜的看守换班口令，茶几上放着紫檀主柜副匙。
<<if $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_4_alt"]>><span class="teal">因为先前用配重缆锁稳了传菜梯厢，你顺着检修竖井悄无声息地摸到了二楼包厢纱帘后。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="velvet-q-5">
<<sneakicon>><<link "顺走副匙 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-5">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['mp_quest_velvet_mirage_4_alt'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 430 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 5)>>
	你借着端盘掩护将紫檀主柜副匙滑入袖袋，并将换班口令记了个一字不差。<span class="green">你取得了后台紫檀主柜副匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你的衣角碰响了茶几边缘的高脚水晶杯，首席执事冷冷挑开纱帘望过来。<span class="red">你在包厢外露出了破绽。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "记下口令 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 570 or ($english or 0) gte 410>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_5_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_5_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你屏住呼吸贴在双层金线纱帘后的立柱阴影里，将首席执事口中的换班口令与钥匙放处一字不差地记下。<span class="green">待执事转身离开，你顺手从茶几下取走了紫檀主柜副匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[潜入拍卖后台主柜 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		二楼走廊远处传来侍者端酒盘的脚步声，挡住了包厢内的低语，你没能听清后半句口令。<span class="red">你连忙往阴影深处缩了半步，避开路过侍者的视线。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
拍卖后台内室里，紫檀主柜的铜锁已经插上副匙，门外走廊忽然响起两名执事急促的皮靴声，退路已被丝绒帏幔封住一半。
<<if $mpClues["mp_quest_velvet_mirage_5_alt"]>><span class="teal">你熟记着刚在纱帘后听清的换班口令与巡逻间隙，在靴声逼近前已摸清了侧窗的退路。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[闪出侧廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="velvet-q-6">
<<sneakicon>><<link "旋开主保险柜 (0:08)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-6">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['mp_quest_velvet_mirage_5_alt'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 470 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 470>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 6)>>
	你无声抽出暗层总账推开通风暗门，执事推门进来时只看见空荡荡的帷幔。<span class="green">你带着暗层总账顺利脱身。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[撤往崖边 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锁舌卡住半秒，两名执事已推门而入，银链与丝绒软鞭瞬间封死了你的去路。<span class="red">你在后台被执事当场截住。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<link "跃出侧窗 (0:08)">><<mpalert 12>><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 460 or ($willpower or 0) gte 610>>
	<<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to 6>>
	你果断挥袖撞翻桌角银烛台扰乱视线，趁丝绒帷幔扬起的瞬间推开侧窗，轻巧跃上了外廊露台。<span class="green">你揣着暗层总账在追兵合围前漂亮地突围而出。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	侧窗的防风铜插销锈得颇紧，你撞翻烛台后一拉未开，两名执事已从后方包抄上来。<span class="red">退路被封，你落入了执事的合围之中。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "镜廊里的快步">>
</div>


:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to 7>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to 7>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_velvet_master_ledger"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_velvet_master_ledger"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你沿着峭壁内侧的隐秘石阶退回安全门廊。怀里的紫檀底账夹着一枚纯银狐面胸针与不记名筹码，将失踪舞者的去向与名流暗账记述得一清二楚。<span class="green">你彻底查明了天鹅绒暗层的幕后交易。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("quest_velvet_mirage_complete")>>
	<<money 1800>><span class="gold">你兑出了夹层里的 £18 不记名筹码。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查后台暗柜 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
折光穹顶室的旋转滑轨槽里卡着半枚刻有校董会徽记的断齿铜轮，旁边留着新鲜的机油擦痕。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0) gte 1 and ($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0) lte 5>><<set _resumePas to "MP Quest Observatory Wing " + (($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0) + 1)>><<walkicon>><<link [[继续翼楼追查 (0:08)|_resumePas]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
<div id="obs-q-1">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "夹出断齿轮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 1)>>
	你取出那枚断齿铜轮，发现背面刻着星图档案室一八九四年画筒的检索暗码。<span class="green">你找到了指向星图室的暗码。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去折光穹顶 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滑轨弹簧突然回弹夹痛了你的手指，沉闷声响在穹顶室里回荡。<span class="red">你被滑轨夹伤了手指。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "松开滑轨卡扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 1)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_observatory_wing_1_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_observatory_wing_1_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你走到折光穹顶室副控制盘前，找准写有检修字样的黄铜手柄往下扳动半格，滑轨卡扣应声松开。<span class="green">你轻松取出了槽内刻有档案室暗码的断齿铜轮。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去星图档案室 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		控制盘下的传动连杆多年未上油，阻力比看上去沉得多，你扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响惊动楼下，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
