	<<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 2)>>
	内套筒滑出一页泛黄的折光图纸，指明标本暗阁的萤石棱镜能映出密卷水印。<span class="green">你取出了百年折光图纸。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去折光穹顶 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	樟木架顶层积灰簌簌落下迷了你的眼睛，你在木梯上晃了晃只得先下来。<span class="red">木梯摇晃令你无功而返。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挑开画筒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300 or ($tending or 0) gte 290>>
	<<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 2)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["mp_quest_observatory_wing_2_alt"]>><<set $mpClues["mp_quest_observatory_wing_2_alt"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你借着天窗微光将薄刀片探入一八九四号画筒底盖缝隙，顺着暗套筒卡槽轻轻一拨便顶开了底盖。<span class="green">内套筒里的百年折光图纸毫发无损地滑入你掌心。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转去标本暗阁 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		档案室门外忽然传来一阵零碎的巡查脚步声，惊得你在木梯上连忙收住刀片。<span class="red">时机不对，你决定等外廊风声过去再动手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回星图档案室 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
