	你拨转赤道仪副轮打开折光天窗，顺着检修铁梯轻巧翻上屋顶连廊。<span class="green">你带着铅封密卷从天窗顺利脱身。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[撤往安全处 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	天窗齿轮卡死，守卫已堵住正门，你匆忙退入隔壁旧档案室却听见门外咔哒落了铁锁。<span class="red">你被反锁进了旧档案室。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "冲出侧廊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#obs-q-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 470 or ($physique or 10000) gte 13100>>
	<<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to 6>>
	你借着赤道仪底座掩护纵身滑入检修滑轨暗槽，赶在铁栅门彻底落锁前从侧廊排水口翻了出去。<span class="green">你怀揣铅封密卷从侧道干净利落地突围脱身。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	检修滑轨暗槽入口被一只旧木箱挡了半边，你挪动木箱时慢了半秒，守卫已反锁了旧档案室大门。<span class="red">退路断绝，你被困在了旧档案室里。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to 7>><<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to 7>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_observatory_board_secret"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_observatory_board_secret"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你在图书馆古籍架后的暗门内停下喘息，撬开铅封密卷匣。里面不仅有早年校董会挪用孤儿院拨款的原始地契，还附着一枚镶金消色差目镜与封存经费。<span class="green">你完整揭开了旧天文翼楼封存的秘密。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("quest_observatory_wing_complete")>>
	<<money 1800>><span class="gold">你取得了密匣内封存的 £18 早期经费。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
